e Pick</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 w-full p-7 text-white z-10\">\n            \n            <div class=\"mb-6\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-2\">\n                    <span class=\"font-normal text-gray-300 mr-1\">List:</span>$250,000\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                    Harry koingsbergstr...<br>\n                    1063 AG Guillaume Briard\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 mb-6\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-medium\">29 m²</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-light\">Living</span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"w-px h-8 bg-gray-600/50\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col text-center\">\n                    <span class=\"text-lg font-medium\">2</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 font-light\">Rooms</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-4 flex justify-between items-center text-sm\">\n                <div class=\"text-gray-400\">\n                    By <span class=\"text-white underline decoration-1 underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-400\">Waleed Sabir</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-gray-500\">\n                    2 days ago\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
